---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Med Spa Service Page Template | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Section scaffolding for modality landing pages emphasizing education-forward narrative, disclaimers-first consult routing.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Service landing template (education-first)</h1>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>Promise-free hero:</strong>
			Context + modality name + reassurance about individualized candidacy assessments.</li>
		<li><strong>Differentiators:</strong>
			Doctor-led vs nurse-led distinctions (only if verifiable)—avoid comparative attacks.</li>
		<li><strong>Consult journey:</strong>
			Prep instructions, timeframe ranges, escalation if contraindications suspected.</li>
		<li><strong>FAQ cluster:</strong>
			Patient phrasing seeded from coordinator logs (de-identified).</li>
		<li><strong>Paired CTAs:</strong>
			Inquiry capture + lower-friction downloadable education where compliant.</li>
	</ol>
	<p>Use internal links tying back to clinician bios without fabricating prestige metrics.</p>
</PageShell>
